<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EMC target price raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EMC target price raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley raised its six to 12 month target price on EMC Corp to $60 per share from $55, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley also raised the EMC 1997 earnings estimate to $2.10 per share from $2.05.  The 1998 view is unchanged at $2.60.</p>
<p>-- After the market close Tuesday, EMC reported second quarter earnings of $0.50 per share versus $0.36 one year ago.</p>
<p>-- Revenues in the quarter grew to $713.5 million from $545 million.</p>
</text>
